--!strict
--[[
	WeaponTypeConfig
	Archetype defaults for each weapon type. Individual weapons (WeaponConfig)
	inherit these and may override Rpm/Magazine or bias stats.

	Stats are 0-100. Units:
	  BaseDamage          body-shot damage per bullet/pellet at Impact 50, delta 0
	  Falloff.Start/End   studs; damage lerps from 1 to MinMultiplier between them
	                      (Range stat stretches both, see DESIGN.md)
	  ReloadTime          seconds to reload at Reload 50 (see WeaponStats)
	  SwapTime            seconds to ready the weapon at Handling 50
	  MaxRange            studs a hitscan ray (or projectile) travels
	  Ads.Fov             camera field of view while aiming
	  Spread              degrees of cone (hip, aimed, per-shot bloom, max bloom)
	  Recoil              degrees kicked per shot and recovery speed per second
	  Projectile.Speed    studs per second for rockets/grenades
]]

